[00:00.00] Amazing grace, how sweet the sound
[00:12.40] That saved a wretch like me
[00:24.10] I once was lost, but now am found
[00:36.55] Was blind, but now I see
[00:48.20] 'Twas grace that taught my heart to fear
[01:00.80] And grace my fears relieved
[01:12.35] How precious did that grace appear
[01:24.90] The hour I first believed
